    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA Ruhanga wenka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abo boona abanyakukora ebisisani bantu bataroho kandi baaruhanga abo aba batamu muno ekitiinisa bati, tibaina mugaso. Abanyakuramya baaruhanga abo, bafu b'amaiso kandi badoma, baliswara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu ayabumbire embandwa rundi ayaheesire ekisisani ekitaina mugaso? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weena anyakukiramya aliswazibwa. Abanyakukora ebisisani, bantu buuntu. Boona beesorooze beeyoleke, nibaija kutukumira kandi nibaija kuswara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuheesi akwata ekicweka ky'ekyoma, akita omu murro. Akwata enyondo, ateera ekyoma eki, nukwo harugemu ekisisani. Obu aba naakikora arumwa enjara, akwatwa iroho kandi ajwaha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omubaizi aleega omuguha, alenga n'ekalaamu ekisisani nambere kiraagarukira; akiranda n'eranda akinganainganiza n'ekyooma ekinyakulenga; akikoramu ekisisani eky'omuntu, ekisisani ky'omuntu ekirungi eky'okuta omunju ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atema emikogoto, akoma omuzo n'omuhomozi, aguleka gunyeetera omu miti ey'ekibira; abyara omukogoto enjura egwitirra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "WIS.13.11+WIS.13.12+WIS.13.13+WIS.13.14+WIS.13.15+WIS.13.16+WIS.13.17+WIS.13.18+WIS.13.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ama 13:11-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuti ogu, omuntu agusenyaho enku nyingi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enku ezi nizo ahembesa omurro ogw'okwota, kandi nizo acumbisa ebyokulya bye. Baitu onu, agukoramu ruhanga ow'okuramya; akoramu ekisisani akiinamira, ekicweka kyagwo akihembamu omurro ha manda gaagwo agarukwaka, nuho ayokya enyama, agirya aiguta. Ayota n'okwota, nubwo agamba ati: Hati natagata, mpembere omurro weewe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekicweka ekisigaireho, akikoramu ruhanga, nikyo ekisisani; akiinamira, akiramya; akyesengereza naagamba ati: Njuna, habwokuba niiwe ruhanga wange!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abo, tibaina ekibarukumanya, tibaina eki barukwetegereza. Tibarukuhweza kandi tibarukuteekereza habwokuba MUKAMA akabaita amaiso nikyo kirukubatanga kuhweza akabaima amagezi, nukwo kuteetegereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Busaho arukuteekereza busaho arukumanya rundi arukwetegereza akagamba ati: Ekicweka ky'omuti gunu, nikyo nahemberemu omurro, ha manda gaagwo, nuho nacumbire ebyokulya, nuho nayokeze enyama nagirya; kandi hati, empinju enyakusigaireho ngiihemu ekintu eky'omuziro?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu anyakwoya iju agira omutima ogw'ebisuba kandi ahaba. Tasobora kwikiriza ekisisani eki akwasire omungaroze, nkooku atali ruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe Yakobbo kandi Isirairi, oijukege ebigambo binu, habwokuba oli muheereza wange; Iwe Isirairi, ninyowe nakubumbire, oli muheereza wange ou ntalyebwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obubi bwawe nkabusingorra nk'arukusingorra ekicu, kandi nkabumaraho nk'arukumaraho ekiho; garuka nambere ndi habwokuba nkakucungura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zina iwe iguru habwokuba MUKAMA nuwe akozire kinu; mutoke inywe ebicweka ebya nyabuyonga, muzine inywe ensozi. Iwe kibira n'emiti yoona enyakurumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
